ds4 is the DeepSeek V4 Flash single-machine reference inference engine by
antirez. HomeAI Cluster vendors it here and builds against its sources to
add PP/SP distribution at the HC tensor boundary between layers. Do not
modify these files casually — if a change is needed, document it in a
patch file under scripts/ds4-patches/ so we can rebase against upstream.
